  "sourceTitle": "Black Risotto",
  "sourceText": "Black Risotto\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nSplash of olive oil\n1 small Onion, chopped\n100 grams Arborio rice\n4 Sachets of squid ink\n50 ml Red wine\n200 ml Strong fish stock, simmering\n1/2 Clove garlic, crushed\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Sweat the onion in the oil and add the rice, the wine and the ink, stir and add the stock ladle by ladle (15 minutes-ish). 2 Stir in the garlic, season and serve.",
